msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Today’s topic is about what teens see online. \n"
"\n"
"Teens see all kinds of things online. Some of it is interesting, some is confusing or upsetting, and some is not even real."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Many teens come across sexual content, often without looking for it. They may feel curious, confused or uncomfortable. These feelings are normal. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Many parents feel unsure how to talk about this. That's normal too. What helps most is staying calm and talking together."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_female_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how talking openly helped @data.characters.media_female_1.name and her teen connect"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "The other day, my son told me that a sexual video had popped up on his phone. I didn’t know what to say and I wanted to panic, but instead I listened first and we could talk. It was an uncomfortable conversation, but I'm glad we had it. Now he knows he can come to me if something online worries or confuses him."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s see how @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name talks to her mother about something she saw online."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hey, look at this! People are saying it’s @data.characters.friend_male_1.name from our school."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No way… look at what he is doing."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah… something doesn’t look right."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "People can fake videos now… make it look like someone did something they didn’t do. They can even put someone’s face on a naked body."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Everyone is sharing it… Should I send it to our WhatsApp group?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah. I mean, everyone has seen it already anyway."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What if it’s not even real? That could mess things up for @data.characters.friend_male_1.name."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name comes home from school and talks to her mother."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Mother, how do you know if something online is real or not?\n"
"\n"
"And is it okay to share it?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Good question. Many things online are not real, including videos and pictures. \n"
"\n"
"Sometimes, sharing things online can be harmful or even illegal."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Before you believe something or share it, it helps to ask: who shared this and why? \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"And think, would sharing this hurt someone?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, that makes sense. Thank you, mother."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about what happened."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What does mother do to help @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name think about this?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, staying calm helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask simple questions"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Questions help your teen think about what they are seeing."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about not sharing too quickly"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, pausing before sharing can prevent harm."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Remind her she can always talk to her"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right. Being open helps our teens trust and share with us."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_mother.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"@data.characters.f1_mother.name did her best to guide @data.characters.f1_daughter_13.name.\n"
"\n"
"When you or your teen are not sure about something online, these questions help."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"🙍🏾 **Who made it?** Knowing who made it helps you decide if you can trust it.\n"
"❓ **Why was it shared?** Some content is made to get attention or to hurt someone.\n"
"⚠️ **Does it seem too good to be true?** If something feels strange, pause before you trust it or share it.\n"
"💙 **Is it okay to share?** Check with the person in the picture first. Sharing can spread something untrue or harmful."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_father.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Not everything online is real, and that is also true for sexual content. \n"
"\n"
"Let's see how @data.characters.f1_father.name starts a conversation with his son, @data.characters.f1_son_14.name."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_father.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_father.name and @data.characters.f1_son_14.name are making a fire for a braai. @data.characters.f1_son_14.name looks at his phone to put on some music."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name, should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name, you know how sometimes things just pop up on your phone?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "For example, you can be scrolling, and suddenly there's a video of people without clothes...and you weren't even looking for that! Has that ever happened to you?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I guess I've seen that."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"That happens to a lot of young people. It may feel strange, or interesting, or confusing. \n"
"\n"
"Just know, you did nothing wrong by seeing something that pops up."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Porn is made to get attention. It does not show how people should treat each other in real life. \n"
"\n"
"It can give you the wrong ideas about sex and relationships."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"If you ever see something that makes you uncomfortable, come to me. I will listen and I won't get angry. \n"
"\n"
"If talking to me about it feels weird, talk to another adult you trust."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, father."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about that conversation."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name? should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Why is it important for father to have this conversation with @data.characters.f1_son_14.name?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name may feel confused or unsure"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Teens can feel curious, uncomfortable or confused after seeing sexual content."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name may get unrealistic ideas about relationships"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Correct. What is shown is often not real and can give confusing ideas about relationships."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "@data.characters.f1_son_14.name needs to know he can talk"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right. When teens feel safe to talk, they are more likely to ask for help."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignoring it may create problems for @data.characters.f1_son_14.name"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Most teens will see this content eventually. Without guidance, teens will try to figure things out on their own."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The following strings should not be translated: 
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
#.      @data.characters.f1_son_14.name
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What rules could father and @data.characters.f1_son_14.name make so it is less likely that @data.characters.f1_son_14.name sees sexual content?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Keep phones in shared spaces"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Charge phones outside the bedroom"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about what to do if something happens"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes. Simple, agreed rules can help teens see less of this and feel safer to ask for help.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Check in regularly"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes, checking in regularly can help your teen know that you are there to support.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"It was good to see @data.characters.f1_son_14.name talk openly with his father.\n"
"\n"
"One day your teen may come to you with something they have seen. How you respond teaches your teen whether it is safe to come to you again."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and take a breath"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Before you answer, take a breath."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask and listen"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Try asking simple, open questions such as:\n"
"\n"
"- “Can you tell me what happened?”\n"
"- “How did it make you feel?”\n"
"- “What do you think about what you saw?”\n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging or rushing to solve the problem."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure and support your teen"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You could say:\n"
"\n"
"- “Thank you for telling me.”\n"
"- “You did not do anything wrong.”\n"
"- “We can work through this together.”\n"
"\n"
"This helps reduce shame and makes it more likely your teen will come to you again."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "End with connection"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let your teen know they can always come to you if something online worries or confuses them."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here are some simple ways you can support your teen when they see or share things online that are confusing or sensitive."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "PREVENT"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You cannot protect your teen from everything online, but simple routines and guidance can help.\n"
"\n"
"For example, leave devices, including phones, in shared family spaces."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @global.library should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"You can agree on family rules together. \n"
"\n"
"Set a good example by following the same rules yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Connect with other parents to agree on similar rules - it’s easier for teens to accept rules that their friends’ families also follow.\n"
"\n"
"Using content filters also helps manage what your teen sees. Tap “Online safety” in the @global.library for tips on how to do that"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "THINK BEFORE YOU SHARE"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Help your teen pause before sharing anything online. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Remind them that some videos and pictures are not real and are not safe to watch or share. \n"
"\n"
"First ask: Could this hurt someone if I share it? Is it real? Who made it? Why was it made and shared? Then practise what they can say out loud: \"I don't send things like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Make sure your teen knows not to share personal information online. \n"
"\n"
"Remind them that sharing sexual, upsetting or harmful content is hurtful, and can get them in trouble too."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "STAY CALM"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"If your teen tells you they saw something upsetting or sexual, stay calm and listen. \n"
"\n"
"Your reaction will teach them whether they feel safe to talk to you about these things."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "More tips"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
#. The string @global.library. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Reassure your teen that they did nothing wrong. Avoid blame or anger so they feel safe coming to you again.\n"
"\n"
"For more tips on how to report harful content, go to “Online safety” in the @global.library."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "TALK RESPECT"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Teens often learn what relationships look like from what they see online. \n"
"\n"
"Help your teen understand that relationships should feel safe, respectful and comfortable for everyone."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s practise how you could respond when your teen sees something online."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Scenario 1: Your teen shows you a video and says: “Everyone is sharing this. Do you think it is real?”"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and ask questions"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry and tell them not to watch things like that"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Say you are not sure and think together"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and discussing together helps your teen think and make safer choices."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Not quite. Angry reactions or avoiding the conversation can stop your teen from sharing. Staying calm helps them feel safe to talk."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's continue practising. How could you respond to this scenario?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Scenario 2: Your teen accidentally saw porn on their phone."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry and blame them"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Reassure it’s not their fault"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignore it"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That may not work. Strong reactions or ignoring it can make your teen feel ashamed and stop them from sharing."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Stay calm and listen"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Staying calm and reassuring your teen helps them feel safe to talk and reduces shame."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask how they felt about what they saw"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes. Ask them how they felt about what they saw. Were they upset or maybe curious? Their answer tells you what kind of support they need."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "This week's home activity: talk with your teen about something they saw online. Ask them what felt interesting, confusing, or strange."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Remember to ask:** \n"
"\n"
"What do you think about it? Do you think it is real? Why do you think it was shared? How can this affect others? \n"
"\n"
"Listen without judging and thank your teen for sharing."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Can you talk with your teen about something they have seen online this week?"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s great! By staying calm and talking together, you help your teen feel safe to share and make better choices online."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I think so"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "You can do it! Try asking your teen about something they have seen online. A simple “What have you been watching lately?” is a great way to start."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s okay. This kind of conversation can feel hard at first. Remember, staying calm and showing interest helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Well done for taking time for yourself today. 🎉 \n"
"\n"
"If you need more support, you can find additional resources and support services in the Parent Library under \"Online Safety\"."
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here is a short video to help you slow down before you go"
msgstr ""

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When everything feels like it is falling apart And you can't help but raise your voice When all the frustrations are beginning to start Remember that you have a choice\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"You can take pause, you can count to 10 Play a game or do something fun You can phone a friend, someone to confide in Remember you're not the only one\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more Because I really couldn't love you more"
msgstr ""
